{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261114/photo/bkn-20261114103356977-1114_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261114105648\"/><p>赤柱正灘泳灘已懸掛紅旗。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日（11月14日）宣布，由於大浪關係，港島南區的赤柱正灘泳灘及大浪灣泳灘；西貢區的銀線灣泳灘及清水灣第二灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該處游泳會有危險，市民請勿在該處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T03:18:37.171422+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T02:33:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T03:12:02.677560+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T03:12:02.677560+00:00","content_hash":"ad39c3b389c67312ee241e369d5d329c2a3ef289d5d6af6907dc406f8454dc41","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}